    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d605">

                <pb facs="0503" n="491" xml:id="pg491"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.512/161: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-04T23:00:00-04:00">May 4, 1942—11
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>84. Your despatch 656, March 3. Despatch 640 has not been received. Your revised
                    draft of <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> is approved on the
                    understanding that the original draft does not raise any question essential to
                    the Department’s consideration of the revised draft.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
